
This directory contains vendored third-party code used by WashiOS.

- `FreeRTOS/`: the minimal FreeRTOS kernel subset used by STM32 Cortex-M4F
  targets. WashiOS uses static allocation and does not rely on runtime heap
  allocation in flight-controlled paths.

Keep this directory focused on audited dependencies. Project application,
core, HAL, and BSP code should live under `src/` and `include/`.
